1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:02,270
Good evening, excellence…

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,550
A meeting with eight people…

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:05,810
for two hours…

4
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:07,550
that's sixteen work hours!

5
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:08,790
And in the end?

6
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,340
not a single decision.

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,780
An effective meeting needs five things:

8
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,020
A goal:

9
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,860
what are we here to decide?

10
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,280
An agenda:

11
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,680
sent beforehand…

12
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,410
not written once we sit down.

13
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:21,420
Time:

14
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,590
a start and an end…

15
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,750
and we respect them.

16
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,040
A chair:

17
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,650
someone who runs the discussion…

18
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,490
and brings us back on topic.

19
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:30,530
And minutes:

20
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,630
who does what… and when.

21
00:00:33,110 --> 00:00:34,330
Those minutes

22
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:36,840
are what ISO 9001 calls

23
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,890
documented information…

24
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:42,160
proof the decision was made.

25
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,350
Remember it this way:

26
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,690
A meeting with no decision…

27
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:47,200
could have been an email.

28
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,415
And you? What's the

29
00:00:48,415 --> 00:00:49,510
longest meeting you attended…

30
00:00:49,570 --> 00:00:50,910
with no decision at all?

31
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:52,510
Tell me in the comments.

32
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:54,520
See you next episode…

33
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:56,260
on Masaa Al-Tamayoz
